WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:17.189
"I have to get to the Metro City Convention Center," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:20.389
"I need to find out who stole the jewels!"

3
00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:24.781
Roxy looked at her friends.

4
00:00:24.782 --> 00:00:27.426
"I'll be back soon," she said.

5
00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.534
"I just remembered something.

6
00:00:29.535 --> 00:00:31.677
I forgot to walk my dog!"

7
00:00:31.678 --> 00:00:35.523
"Okay," said Terrell. "See you in a little—"

8
00:00:35.524 --> 00:00:42.192
Roxy ran off.

9
00:00:42.193 --> 00:00:44.933
Roxy arrived at the Convention Center.

10
00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:46.825
She saw a crowd of people.

11
00:00:46.826 --> 00:00:48.580
They looked upset.

12
00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.637
All of the jewelry cases were empty.

13
00:00:51.638 --> 00:00:58.639
"Rocket Girl!" Detective Smith called when he saw Roxy.

14
00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.611
"I'm glad you're here."

15
00:01:00.612 --> 00:01:02.131
Roxy smiled.

16
00:01:02.132 --> 00:01:05.210
"What are you doing here, Detective?

17
00:01:05.211 --> 00:01:07.902
Shopping for a diamond ring?"

18
00:01:07.903 --> 00:01:11.432
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

19
00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:13.985
"This is serious, Rocket Girl.

20
00:01:13.986 --> 00:01:17.724
Someone stole a lot of valuable jewels."

21
00:01:17.725 --> 00:01:20.086
"I know," said Roxy.

22
00:01:20.087 --> 00:01:22.490
"Have you found any clues?"

23
00:01:22.491 --> 00:01:24.954
"No," said Detective Smith.

24
00:01:24.955 --> 00:01:27.970
"But this wasn't the only robbery tonight.

25
00:01:27.971 --> 00:01:34.113
Jewels were also stolen from the party at the Metro City Grand Hotel."

26
00:01:34.114 --> 00:01:36.390
"Hmm," said Roxy.

27
00:01:36.391 --> 00:01:38.927
"Maybe it's the same thieves.

28
00:01:38.928 --> 00:01:42.452
Jewels were stolen both times."

29
00:01:42.453 --> 00:01:48.430
"Yes!" said a man. "Very valuable jewels.

30
00:01:48.431 --> 00:01:53.512
Those horrible thieves stole my entire collection of rare emeralds!"

31
00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:57.799
"They took my ruby earrings!" said a tall woman.

32
00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:03.183
"And my diamond sunglasses!" said an old woman with blue hair.

33
00:02:03.184 --> 00:02:09.317
She sniffed. "They were my favorite sunglasses."

34
00:02:09.318 --> 00:02:12.821
"Can anyone tell us what happened?" asked Detective Smith.

35
00:02:12.822 --> 00:02:15.472
He took a small notebook out of his pocket.

36
00:02:15.473 --> 00:02:18.361
"Did any of you see anything?"

37
00:02:18.362 --> 00:02:20.707
The tall woman stepped forward.

38
00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:24.240
"I didn't see anything," she said.

39
00:02:24.241 --> 00:02:27.919
"But I heard something—a loud rumble.

40
00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:31.189
It sounded like a bunch of motorcycles."

41
00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:34.433
"I heard the rumble too," said the man.

42
00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:37.725
"Then I heard a zapping sound."

43
00:02:37.726 --> 00:02:41.212
"There was a bolt of electricity," his wife added.

44
00:02:41.213 --> 00:02:43.285
"Next the lights went out.

45
00:02:43.286 --> 00:02:48.142
When the lights came back on, all the jewels were gone!"

46
00:02:48.143 --> 00:02:52.744
"The thieves even took my brand-new diamond tiara," said another woman.

47
00:02:52.745 --> 00:02:56.834
"I was going to wear it to the exhibit tomorrow!"

48
00:02:56.835 --> 00:02:59.510
"What exhibit?" asked Roxy.

49
00:02:59.511 --> 00:03:03.365
"You don't know?" said the woman with blue hair.

50
00:03:03.366 --> 00:03:05.468
She looked surprised.

51
00:03:05.469 --> 00:03:11.083
"The crown jewels will be on display at the Metro City Museum."

52
00:03:11.084 --> 00:03:14.656
"The crown jewels are magnificent," said the man.

53
00:03:14.657 --> 00:03:17.808
"They just arrived in Metro City today.

54
00:03:17.809 --> 00:03:21.355
And tomorrow the exhibit will be open to the public.

55
00:03:21.356 --> 00:03:26.002
It's the biggest, most valuable collection of jewels in the world."

56
00:03:26.003 --> 00:03:28.783
Roxy gasped.

57
00:03:28.784 --> 00:03:38.092
"I know what the jewel thieves are going to steal next—the crown jewels!"
